(CORVANE SYSTEMS - ACCESS CONTROL STANDARD CS-AC-01) Tj T*
(Revision A. Approved November 2018.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2 Passwords) Tj T*
(Passwords SHALL be at least 10 characters long.) Tj T*
(Accounts SHALL be locked after 5 failed sign-in attempts.) Tj T*
(Passwords SHALL NOT be stored in plain text.) Tj T*
(Page 2) Tj T*
ET
