50 752 Td
(CORVANE SYSTEMS - ACCESS CONTROL STANDARD CS-AC-01) Tj T*
(Revision A. Approved November 2018.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3 Sessions) Tj T*
(At AL1, users SHALL be reauthenticated after 2 hours of inactivity.) Tj T*
(At AL2, users SHALL be reauthenticated after 30 minutes of inactivity.) Tj T*
(At AL2, sessions SHALL be reauthenticated at least once every 8 hours, regardless of activity.) Tj T*
(Page 3) Tj T*
ET
endstream
